ata-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20151002235450&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Enchanted_Amethyst_22749c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a small enchanted amethyst.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.10 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>One small enchanted amethyst is needed to to enchant a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Shield\">Rainbow Shield</a> with energy for 15 minutes.\nKnights need 20 of these in <a href=\"#/quest/elemental-spheres-quest\">The Elemental Spheres Quest</a>.<br/>\n2 are needed during the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before Summer Update 2017, <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethysts</a> could be enchanted by Premium <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">Level</a> 30 or higher at <a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Shrines\">Holy Shrines</a> with the Energy element.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppe